"Each game lasts 20 turns. Build your army before you attack. A rival defends "
"its home land, so a weak attack will lose. Watch your food: if your people "
"run out of food, they starve and your empire shrinks."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: README.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: README.md:140
msgid ""
"The design notes are in [`docs/superpowers/specs/`](docs/superpowers/specs/)."
