"Immortal Barons is a strategy game. You rule an empire in a broken world. "
"You build an economy, raise an army, and compete with other rulers. You play "
"a set number of turns each day."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/playing.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "The player guide is the in-game help"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/playing.md:11
msgid ""
"The guide lives inside the game as **categorized help**. Open it from the "
"Game Menu (Help Database), or press `?` at a menu. It is organized by "
"category:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/playing.md:18
msgid "**Controls** — moving through the menus, entering numbers"
